<title>UK: EUROPEAN PRECIOUS MTALS CLOSE MIXED, OFF FLOOR.</title>
<headline>EUROPEAN PRECIOUS MTALS CLOSE MIXED, OFF FLOOR.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $321.90/$322.40 vs $319.50/$320.00. Finished ahead after finding support at earlier lows. Fairly quiet. Comex option expiry Friday.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finished up two cents at $4.38/$4.40.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Ended at $434.00/$437.00, down $3.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Closed at $219.00/$222.00 down $9.00.</p>
</text>
